              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nikyo MUKAMA arikugambira aha bya baanabi abarikuhanuura omu iziina ryangye, haza ntabatumire, bakgira bati: Rurara n'ejara tibiriteera egi nsi; naagira ati: Baanabi abo nibaija kumarwaho rurara n'ejara; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.15"
